Hello,

find below the certificates of the 18 active participants of the
keysigning events at LPC and OSS in Prague earlier this month that are
also (already) in the keyring and received new signatures.

Currently (= 629c0df0eae6) and ignoring SHA1 bound signatures the strong
set in the pgpkeys repo contains 171 certificates with an average
distance of 4.2632610939112485 and a maximal distance of 13.

With the signatures below the strong set grows to 206 certificates
with an average distance of 3.8264030310206016 and a maximal distance of
11. Among the 19 best connected certficates there is only Greg
Kroah-Hartman's that didn't get new signatures in Prague. Importing
these signatures affects the signature paths from Greg to 97
certificates.

I like this result, thanks to everyone who cooperated for it!

Best regards
Uwe

